[statement]
A `!` entry in the request replaces the world's entry for its name and
removes the package, and what only that package needed.

[repository]
P:a
V:1.0-r0
D:lib

P:lib
V:1.0-r0

[installed]
P:lib
V:1.0-r0

P:a
V:1.0-r0
D:lib

[world]
a

[request]
!a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove a 1.0-r0
remove lib 1.0-r0
